# Agent tooling state. These are working directories, not source: .conclave/
# holds session event logs containing recorded prompt and output text, and
# .claude/ and .codex/ hold local settings for whoever is driving. This repo is
# public, so anything `git add -A` sweeps in is world-readable the moment it is
# pushed, with no undo. Ignored so that mistake cannot be made.
.claude/
.codex/
.conclave/
